  "quest.218B27E516AAD42D.title": "Red Print",
  "quest.218B27E516AAD42D.quest_desc": [
    "Red Print \u2014 copies a dank frequency to another bag of the same tier.",
    "",
    "Sneak-use on source dank, then target dank to sync frequencies. Only works within matching tiers.",
    "",
    "Essential for linking input, void, and construction danks in a skyblock storage wall."
